{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"1488","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"清潔能源崛起 能源總署：太陽能投資將首度超越石油","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2023-05-25 20:14 中央社／巴黎25日綜合外電報導</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E8%83%BD%E6%9D%BF.png\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">國際能源總署報告指出，由於清潔能源支出超過化石燃料，預估今年太陽能投資將首度超越石油。美聯社</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 0px; height: 1px; margin: 20px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">國際能源總署今天在報告中說，由於清潔能源支出超過化石燃料，預估今年太陽能投資將首度超越石油。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">法新社報導，雖然這是值得歡迎的發展，但國際能源總署（International Energy Agency, IEA）警告，化石燃料投資正在增加，而為了在2050年實現凈零排放的目標，化石燃料的投資應該迅速下降。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">國際能源總署執行董事比羅爾（Fatih Birol）在能源總署最新能源投資報告發布的聲明中說：「清潔能源發展迅速，比許多人意識到的要快。」</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">他說：「這在投資趨勢中很明顯，清潔能源科技正在拉開與化石燃料的距離。」</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">根據能源總署的數據，今年清潔能源的投資預估將比2021年增加24%，到2023年將會超過1兆7000億美元。同一時期的化石燃料投資增幅為15%。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">僅在5年前，清潔能源和化石燃料的投資額是相等的。但在結合各種因素下，特別是石油和天然氣的價格高昂和對供應的擔憂，導致可再生能源的支出激增超前。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">比羅爾說：「一個鮮明的例子是對太陽能的投資，它將首度超過石油生產的投資額。」</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">能源總署預估，今年對太陽能發電的投資將達到3800億美元，而這筆投資主要用在太陽能光電板，而對石油勘探和開採的投資應會達到3700億美元。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">能源智庫Ember的數據分析主管瓊斯（Dave Jones）說：「這使得太陽能成為真正的能源超級強權。」</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\">資料來源:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://udn.com/news/story/6811/7190963?from=udn-referralnews_ch2artbottom\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(197, 224, 180); text-decoration-line: none; outline: 0px !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/6811/7190963?from=udn-referralnews_ch2artbottom</span></a></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2023-05-30","clk_count":"14"}},"__N_SSG":true}